                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H^{dim(X^H)}\Big( Y^H , \mathbb{Z}\Big) \simeq \mathbb{Z}
                  and hence orientation behaviour
                  %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:OrientationBehaviour"} (3)
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi e
