            %h6#proof_3 Proof
            %p
              This follows as a special case of the equivariant Hopf degree theorem (Theorem
              = succeed ")." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#EquivariantHopfDegreeTheorem"}
            %p
              Here
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
