                    S^{\mathbb{H}}
                    \\right]
                    \&amp;\mapsto&amp;
                    deg\left( c^{ \{e\}  }\right)
                    \&amp;\mapsto&amp;
                    deg\left( c^{ \{e\}  }\right) - 1
                    \&amp;\mapsto&amp;
                    \\big(
                    deg\left( c^{ \{e\}  }\right) - 1
